1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:05,830
Cun Ana cun pun, pemiwo pu tu ke ce kome pa ta. Cu puye ka sama co?
Ana, your report never reached me. What's the problem?

2
00:00:05,930 --> 00:00:10,040
Ta ka seni ponino pen ti. Cu penawe pu ta ke tana.
I feel terrible about this. My computer died.

3
00:00:10,140 --> 00:00:14,250
Kume ke kiyu. Cu te ke caye pemiwo pi solu ti.
The boss was angry. She needed the report today.

4
00:00:14,350 --> 00:00:18,940
Ta ka kono, sa tu ka tuli. Cu ta ke caye pala pa tu pume.
I know, and you're right. I should have told you sooner.

5
00:00:19,040 --> 00:00:22,190
Ca tu ki kalo pemiwo sinu pi solulu ti?
Could you make a new report by this evening?

6
00:00:22,290 --> 00:00:27,680
Ka. Cu ta ko kalo to pi solulu ti. Cu ta ka tane tu pan so tu ke tewo.
Yes. I'll have it done this evening. Thank you for waiting.

7
00:00:27,780 --> 00:00:31,090
Sala, sawi. Cu tan ka kuyu.
It's all right, friend. We're a team.

